Offset help

Offset opens on Receive.
o) Switch between Receive and Transmit.
Full stop) Increase the selected offset by 10 Hz.
Comma) Decrease the selected offset by 10 Hz.
v) Read both offsets. An inactive offset reads zero.
c) Clear both offsets and turn them off.
q) Return to Top Level and keep the settings.

